§7§lFrail Rogues\n\n\
§0Skeletons are a peculiar manifestation of the Night Terror's influence, with no muscles or organs to speak of. \
Their continued motor functions are difficult to explain, \
though their behavior suggests that whatever animates—"
data modify storage bittersweet:almanac book.pages append value "\
—them is not entirely mindless nor instinctual. They gather in greater numbers after repeated nights of troubled sleep, as all undead do. \
Furthermore, they can rarely carry a flint axe capable of knocking your shield off balance. \
Even while in chase,—"
data modify storage bittersweet:almanac book.pages append value "\
—when hit by a skeleton's arrow, hostile creatures will move their attention to the skeleton. Use this to your advantage."

